        "original_id": "a748c70c-6ec3-551b-b750-90269e9638f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom, Amber, Sally, Steve, Katherine Parkinson, Justin Edwards, Simon Blackwell, Jesse Armstrong, Sam Bain\n- Works: The Old Guys, The IT Crowd, The Thick of It, In The Loop, Veep, Peep Show, Four Lions\n- Awards: British Comedy Best TV Actress Award, BAFTA TV Award\n- Roles: Jen Barber\n\nFacts:\n- In The Old Guys, baby boomer Tom has little in life except his daughter Amber.\n- In The Old Guys, Amber is played by Katherine Parkinson and dates Sally's son Steve.\n- In The Old Guys, Steve is played by Justin Edwards.\n- Katherine Parkinson appeared as Jen Barber in Channel 4's The IT Crowd.\n- Katherine Parkinson won the British Comedy Best TV Actress Award in 2009 for The IT Crowd.\n- Katherine Parkinson received a BAFTA TV Award nomination in 2011 and won a BAFTA TV Award in 2014 for The IT Crowd.\n- Simon Blackwell is best known for work on The Thick of It, In The Loop, and Veep.\n- Simon Blackwell collaborated with Jesse Armstrong and Sam Bain on Peep Show, Four Lions, and The Old Guys.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
